### 45c. [2026-03-19 ~00:50] R2 convergence: blind re-do until stable
每個模型 R2 重做, 與自己R1 結果時再來大聲, 不一致時就多做一兩次, 直到連續兩次R2 一致時算為穩定, 然後來為自己的 R2 結果辯論

### 45d. [2026-03-19 ~01:00] R1 is unanimous-only — no 2/3 shortcut
R1 tests if the task is "easy enough" that all 3 independently agree. If even one differs, we want the convergence + debate process to figure out why. R1 is strictly unanimous or nothing.

